 Standard C}}}{\pard\plain \sa120\widctlpar\adjustright \v\fs20\cgrid {\xe {C\: Standard C}}}{.\rquote  Only if it is necessary to distinguish between Standard C and older, pre-Standard versions of  C will I make the distinction.
