{\pard\plain \sa120\widctlpar\tx720\tx1440\tx2160\tx2880\tx3600\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8640\adjustright \v\fs20\cgrid {\xe {type-checking}}}{, so in C++ it means \ldblquote a function with no arguments.\rdblquote 
