\par The complement of }{\b #define}{ is }{\b #undef}{\pard\plain \sa120\widctlpar{\*\pn \pnlvlcont\ilvl0\ls0\pnrnot0\pndec }\adjustright \v\fs20\cgrid {\xe {#undef}}}{ (short for \ldblquote un-define\rdblquote ), which will make an }{\b #ifdef }{
