\par }\pard\plain \sa120\widctlpar{\*\pn \pnlvlcont\ilvl0\ls0\pnrnot0\pndec }\adjustright \fs20\cgrid {Because structures are also aggregates, they can be initialized in a similar fashion. Because a C-style }{\b struct}{ has all its members }{\b public}{
, they can be assigned directly:
