 aggregate initialization and structures}}}{\pard\plain \sa120\widctlpar{\*\pn \pnlvlcont\ilvl0\ls0\pnrnot0\pndec }\adjustright \v\fs20\cgrid {\xe {aggregate\: initialization and structures}}}{
 you have an array of such objects, you can initialize them by using a nested set of curly braces for each object:
\par }\pard\plain \s25\li360\sa60\sl240\slmult0\widctlpar\brdrl\brdrs\brdrw15\brsp200 {\*\pn \pnlvlcont\ilvl0\ls0\pnrnot0\pndec }\adjustright \f6\fs20\lang1024\kerning18\cgrid {X x2[3] = \{ \{1, 1.1, 'a'\}, \{2, 2.2, 'b'\} \};
