\par }\pard\plain \sa120\widctlpar\adjustright \fs20\cgrid {You will see }{\b static}{ and }{\b extern}{ used commonly. There are two other storage class specifiers that occur less often. The }{\b auto}{ }{\pard\plain \sa120\widctlpar\adjustright 
