\rquote re stuck typing those names. (A }{\b typedef}{ is often used to simplify this.) It\rquote s not an elegant, language-supported solution.
\par You can subdivide the global name space into more manageable pieces using the }{\i namespace}{ }{\pard\plain \sa120\widctlpar\adjustright \v\fs20\cgrid {\xe {namespace}}}{feature of C++.}{\cs23\fs16\up6 \chftn {\footnote \pard\plain 
