uring testing. This ensures that the definition happens only once and that it\rquote s in the hands of the class creator.
\par The entire initialization expression for a static member }{\pard\plain \sa120\widctlpar{\*\pn \pnlvlcont\ilvl0\ls0\pnrnot0\pndec }\adjustright \v\fs20\cgrid {\xe {scope\: of static member initialization}}}{is in the scope of the class. For example,
