\par There\rquote s a simple technique for preventing pass-by-value: Declare a }{\b private}{ copy-constructor}{\pard\plain \sa120\widctlpar{\*\pn \pnlvlcont\ilvl0\ls0\pnrnot0\pndec }\adjustright \v\fs20\cgrid {\xe {private\: copy-constructor}}}{. You don
