\par }\pard\plain \sa120\widctlpar{\*\pn \pnlvlcont\ilvl0\ls0\pnrnot0\pndec }\adjustright \fs20\cgrid {Now suppose you have an ordinary pointer to an integer, }{\b ip}{. To access what }{\b ip}{ is pointing to, you dereference the pointer with a }{\b *}{:

