\par }\pard\plain \sa120\widctlpar{\*\pn \pnlvlcont\ilvl0\ls0\pnrnot0\pndec }\adjustright \fs20\cgrid {There is actually no \ldblquote address\rdblquote  of }{\b simple::a}{ because you\rquote 
