s of all overloaded}}}{The following listing repeats the example of }{\b Unary.cpp}{ for binary operators. Both global versions and member function versions are shown.
\par }\pard\plain \s24\li360\sl240\slmult0\widctlpar\brdrl\brdrs\brdrw15\brsp200 \adjustright \f6\fs20\lang1024\kerning18\cgrid {//: C12:Binary.cpp
