\par All of this \endash  setting up the VTABLE for each class, initializing the VPTR, inserting the code for the virtual function call \endash  happens automatically, so you don\rquote 
t have to worry about it. With virtual functions, the proper function gets called for an object, even if the compiler cannot know the specific type of the object.
\par The following sections go into this process in more detail.
