 pure virtual function definitions}}}{\pard\plain \sa120\widctlpar{\*\pn \pnlvlcont\ilvl0\ls0\pnrnot0\pndec }\adjustright \v\fs20\cgrid {\xe {definition\: pure virtual function definitions}}}{It\rquote 
s possible to provide a definition for a pure virtual function in the base class. You\rquote re still telling the compiler not to allow objects of that pure abstract base class, and the pure virtual functions must be defined in derived
