\par {\pntext\pard\plain\s43 \f4\lang1024\cgrid \hich\af4\dbch\af0\loch\f4 7. \tab}}\pard \s43\fi-360\li1440\widctlpar\jclisttab\tx1440{\*\pn \pnlvlbody\ilvl0\ls210\pnrnot0\pndec\pnb0\pni0\pnf4\pnfs24\pnstart1\pnindent1440\pnhang{\pntxta . }}
\ls210\adjustright {(Advanced) Modify the }{\b TStack}{ class to further increase the granularity of ownership: add a flag to each link indicating whether that link owns the object it points to, and support this information in the }{\b add(\~)}{
 function and destructor. Add member functions to read and change the ownership for each link, and decide what the }{\b _owns}{ flag means in this new context.
\par {\pntext\pard\plain\s43 \f4\lang1024\cgrid \hich\af4\dbch\af0\loch\f4 8. \tab}}\pard \s43\fi-360\li1440\widctlpar\jclisttab\tx1440{\*\pn \pnlvlbody\ilvl0\ls210\pnrnot0\pndec\pnb0\pni0\pnf4\pnfs24\pnstart1\pnindent1440\pnhang{\pntxta . }}
