 header declares the standard exception classes }{\pard\plain \sa120\widctlpar\adjustright \v\fs20\cgrid {\xe {Standard C++ libraries\: standard exception classes}}}{\pard\plain \sa120\widctlpar\adjustright \v\fs20\cgrid {\xe {exception handling\:
