, a set of }{\i function objects}{\pard\plain \sa120\widctlpar\adjustright \v\fs20\cgrid {\xe {function\: function objects}}}{ for support of the STL, and storage allocation functions for use with the STL}{\pard\plain \sa120\widctlpar\adjustright 
