\par Numerics Library}{\pard\plain \sa120\widctlpar\adjustright \v\fs20\cgrid {\xe {Standard C++ libraries\: numerics library}}}{
. The goal of this library is to allow the compiler implementor to take advantage of the architecture of the underlying machine when used for numerical operations}{\pard\plain \sa120\widctlpar\adjustright \v\fs20\cgrid {\xe {numerical operations\:
