 and defer initializing it with character data
\par {\pntext\pard\plain\f3\fs20\cgrid \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}}\pard \fi-360\li360\sa120\widctlpar\jclisttab\tx360{\*\pn \pnlvlblt\ilvl0\ls232\pnrnot0\pnf3\pnstart1\pnindent360\pnhang{\pntxtb \'b7}}\ls232\adjustright {Initialize a }{\b string}{
 by passing a literal, quoted character array as an argument to the constructor
