\par }\pard\plain \sa120\widctlpar\adjustright \fs20\cgrid {The iterators are not restricted to }{\b begin(\~)}{ and }{\b end(\~)}{, so you can choose a subset of characters from the source }{\b string}{.{\*\bkmkstart _Toc424692474}
