\par }\pard\plain \sa120\widctlpar\adjustright \fs20\cgrid {\b operator+}{ and }{\b operator+= }{are a very flexible and}{\b  }{convenient means of combining }{\b string}{
 data. On the right hand side of the statement, you can use almost any type that evaluates to a group of one or more characters. }{\f4\fs44\lang1024 
