\par A }{\i stream}{ }{\pard\plain \sa120\widctlpar{\*\pn \pnlvlcont\ilvl0\ls0\pnrnot0\pndec }\adjustright \v\fs20\cgrid {\xe {stream}}}{is an object that formats and holds bytes. You can have an input stream (}{\i istream}{\pard\plain 
