\v\fs20\cgrid {\xe {ostrstream}}}{for }{\b char*}{ }{\pard\plain \sa120\widctlpar{\*\pn \pnlvlcont\ilvl0\ls0\pnrnot0\pndec }\adjustright \v\fs20\cgrid {\xe {char* iostreams}}}{memory (in-core formatting), and }{\i istringstreams}{ }{\pard\plain 
