}}{for interfacing with the Standard C++ }{\b string}{ class}{\pard\plain \sa120\widctlpar{\*\pn \pnlvlcont\ilvl0\ls0\pnrnot0\pndec }\adjustright \v\fs20\cgrid {\xe {Standard C++ libraries\: string class}}}{\pard\plain 
