\sa120\widctlpar{\*\pn \pnlvlcont\ilvl0\ls0\pnrnot0\pndec }\adjustright \v\fs20\cgrid {\xe {iostreams\: seeking in}}}{Each type of iostream has a concept of where its \ldblquote next\rdblquote  character will come from (if it\rquote s an }{\b istream}{
) or go (if it\rquote s an }{\b ostream}{). In some situations you may want to move this stream position. You can do it using two models: One uses an absolute location in the stream called the }{\b streampos}{\pard\plain 
