\pndec }\adjustright \v\fs20\cgrid {\xe {fseek(\~)}}}{\pard\plain \sa120\widctlpar{\*\pn \pnlvlcont\ilvl0\ls0\pnrnot0\pndec }\adjustright \v\fs20\cgrid {\xe {iostreams\: fseek(\~)}}}{ for a file and moves a given number
 of bytes from the beginning, end, or current position in the file.
\par The }{\b streampos}{ approach requires that you first call a \ldblquote tell\rdblquote  function: }{\b tellp(\~)}{\pard\plain \sa120\widctlpar{\*\pn \pnlvlcont\ilvl0\ls0\pnrnot0\pndec }\adjustright \v\fs20\cgrid {\xe {tellp(\~)}}}{\pard\plain 
