\rdblquote }{\pard\plain \sa120\widctlpar{\*\pn \pnlvlcont\ilvl0\ls0\pnrnot0\pndec }\adjustright \v\fs20\cgrid {\xe {put pointer}}}{ and the \ldblquote g\rdblquote  refers to the \ldblquote get pointer.\rdblquote ) This function returns a }{\b streampos}{
 you can later use in the single-argument version of }{\b seekp(\~)}{\pard\plain \sa120\widctlpar{\*\pn \pnlvlcont\ilvl0\ls0\pnrnot0\pndec }\adjustright \v\fs20\cgrid {\xe {seekp(\~)}}}{\pard\plain \sa120\widctlpar{\*\pn \pnlvlcont\ilvl0\ls0\pnrnot0
\pndec }\adjustright \v\fs20\cgrid {\xe {iostreams\: seekp(\~)}}}{ for an }{\b ostream}{ or }{\b seekg(\~)}{\pard\plain \sa120\widctlpar{\*\pn \pnlvlcont\ilvl0\ls0\pnrnot0\pndec }\adjustright \v\fs20\cgrid {\xe {seekg(\~)}}}{\pard\plain 
