\par }\pard\plain \sa120\widctlpar\adjustright \fs20\cgrid {As they are destroyed or in other cases where the pointers are removed, the STL containers }{\i do not}{ call }{\b delete}{ for the pointers they contain. If you create an object on the heap with }{
