\par }\pard\plain \sa120\widctlpar\adjustright \fs20\cgrid {Now the operation of reading the file is in the constructor:
\par }\pard\plain \s25\li360\sa60\sl240\slmult0\widctlpar\brdrl\brdrs\brdrw15\brsp200 \adjustright \f6\fs20\lang1024\kerning18\cgrid {FileEditor file(argv[1]);
