s is sometimes called a \ldblquote diamond\rdblquote  in the inheritance hierarchy. Without diamonds}{\pard\plain \sa120\widctlpar\adjustright \v\fs20\cgrid {\xe {multiple inheritance\: diamonds}}}{\pard\plain \sa120\widctlpar\adjustright \v\fs20\cgrid 
