\par The ellipses give you no possibility to have an argument or to know anything about the type of the exception. It\rquote s a catch\_all.
\par }\pard\plain \s3\li360\sb120\sa60\sl-480\slmult0\keep\keepn\widctlpar{\*\pn \pnlvlcont\ilvl0\ls0\pnrnot0\pndec }\outlinelevel2\adjustright \f4\fs44\lang1024\cgrid {{\*\bkmkstart _Toc312374119}{\*\bkmkstart _Toc451776471}Rethrowing an exception
