\par At this point, you might wonder about the \lquote }{\b +}{\rquote , \lquote }{\b =,}{\rquote  and \lquote }{\b &}{\rquote . What if those are used in the field, as in \ldblquote John & Marsha Smith\rdblquote ? This is encoded to: 
